  "solution": {
    "text": "Let chord of contact is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> that touches <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> at <math><mi>R</mi></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0015_6870cc423a52.png\" style=\"height: 157px; width: 190px;\" /><br />Now, assume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Equation of <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is <math><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>for</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Again, the equation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>"
